<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BankAmerica cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BankAmerica cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it downgraded BankAmerica Corp to outperform from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- BankAmerica closed Thursday at 68-15/16.</p>
</text>
